      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers consistently praise the staff at this East Harlem store for being welcoming, courteous, and attentive. Multiple reviewers mention employees going out of their way to carry heavy supplies or source emergency aquariums on short notice. A single customer reported feeling dismissed after asking about merchandise rates."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
